WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.700
- Hey, Legal Eagles, I
thought I would take a break

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.640
from your regularly scheduled programming

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.870
to give you a sneak peek of my new office.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.540
As you can see, it's filled
with many leather bound books

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.610
and it smells of rich mahogany.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.950
A couple of Eagle-eyed
viewers, pun intended,

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:15.780
noticed that the books had changed

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.910
in my regular shooting location.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.310
And it's in locations like this

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.790
that I plan on shooting a whole bunch

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.010
of new videos in 2021 in
ramping up production.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:26.150
And speaking of which,
only until January 1st

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.960
can you get 41% off of
CuriosityStream and Nebula

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.570
where I put extended
versions of all of my videos.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:33.510
So check that out and as always,

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.490
I'll see you in court

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:36.423
or in this office.

